  "goodToKnow": "Untergeben means subordinate: jemandem untergeben sein (to report to someone). Der/die Untergebene (declined like an adjective) is a subordinate, the opposite of der/die Vorgesetzte (superior). The word sounds hierarchical and old-fashioned; modern workplaces prefer Mitarbeiter or das Team. Unterstellt is a neutral synonym."
